# `<name>._native.native_decide.ax_*` axiom). One fully-qualified name per line.
# Read by scripts/lean-axiom-audit.sh; every other native_decide is a red gate.
# native_decide puts the Lean compiler + the host's evaluator in the TCB of the
# theorem — disclosed in CONJECTURES.md ("native_decide is in the TCB").
# Theorems that merely depend on one of these inherit the disclosure; a NEW
# native_decide anywhere else must be added here, by name, with a reason.
